    "updated_at": "2025-03-02T04:06:57Z",
    "body": "Well I know it has a constructor today, the question was, should it?\r\n\r\nIf the intention is that we can only get a `NavigationDestination` from another event, that's a pretty useless constructor, no? Creating a `NavigateEvent` from an existing `NavigateEvent` seems like it'd be a niche need?\r\n\r\nFair enough if this is the intention, just seems kinda odd to have a constructor for an event that you can't actually construct without already having that event on hand.",
